# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps host build output
# from leaking into an image. Copying a locally-built bin/ would ship whatever
# happened to be on a developer machine rather than what the Dockerfile built.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/

docs/
tests/

# Generated by Reqnroll during a local build. Regenerated inside the image if
# ever needed, and stale copies are exactly the hazard that once made four
# scenarios silently stop running.
**/*.feature.cs

**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
*.user
